    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day X is an immersive, interactive fiction adventure told in a gripping graphic novel style. Step into the boots of Jason Miller, a Navy SEAL caught in the chaos of a nuclear strike on the United States\u2014just as a deadly bioweapon is unleashed, turning men into flesh-eating monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the story unfolds, you control the narrative\u2014every decision you make shapes your path. Choose wisely, as your actions can unlock new storylines, forge unexpected alliances, or lead you to a sudden, deadly end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With multiple branching storylines, life-and-death decisions, and several unique endings, this is more than just a story\u2014it's your own gripping, choose-your-own-adventure. Read, decide, and survive.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day X is an immersive, interactive fiction adventure told in a gripping graphic novel style. Step into the boots of Jason Miller, a Navy SEAL caught in the chaos of a nuclear strike on the United States\u2014just as a deadly bioweapon is unleashed, turning men into flesh-eating monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the story unfolds, you control the narrative\u2014every decision you make shapes your path. Choose wisely, as your actions can unlock new storylines, forge unexpected alliances, or lead you to a sudden, deadly end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With multiple branching storylines, life-and-death decisions, and several unique endings, this is more than just a story\u2014it's your own gripping, choose-your-own-adventure. Read, decide, and survive.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Day X is an interactive graphic novel where you play as Jason Miller, a Navy SEAL fighting to survive a nuclear strike and a bioweapon outbreak. Your choices shape the story, leading to branching paths, alliances, and multiple endings. Choose wisely\u2014survive or perish.",
